# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000032> (scalar measurement datum)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000032> "A scalar measurement datum is a measurement datum that is composed of two parts, numerals and a unit label."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000032> "scalar measurement datum"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000032> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000109>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000032> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001938> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001931>))
