AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000100> "data set"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000100> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027>)

