# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0500006> (parallel group design)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0500006> "A parallel group design or independent measure design is a study design which uses unique experimental unit each experimental group, in other word no two individuals are shared between experimental groups, hence also known as parallel group design. Subjects of a treatment group receive a unique combination of independent variable values making up a treatment"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0500006> "parallel group design"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0500006> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0500000>)

